<title>UK: UK's Unipart in services deal with VW.</title>
<headline>UK's Unipart in services deal with VW.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>British automotive industry supplier Unipart said on Friday it agreed in principle to supply a range of parts logistics services to Volkswagen Group UK, the British unit of Germany's Volkswagen AG.</p>
<p>Unipart said Volkswagen's car parts business in Britain was worth 200 million pounds. It did not specify how much the logistics contract was worth.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
